  "query_preview": "(Friday through Monday)...\nFor Saturday through Monday, high pressure will begin to weaken\nacross the area as a low pressure system develops near the\nCalifornia coast, strengthening onshore lower level flow. High\ntemperatures will fall to around 5 degrees above average on Sunday\nand a few degrees below average for the mountains and inland\nvalleys on Monday. Monday high temperatures will range from the\nmid 70s to lower 80s near the coast to the 90s for the Inland\nEmpire with 104 to 108 for the lower deserts.",
